  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=5c2a21\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fobscure-tooltips-media-kit-VPpfjxP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Media Kit\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get Media Kit-5c4521?style=for-the-badge&logo=imgur&labelColor=251C20&logoColor=white\"></a>\n</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">《Obscure Tooltips》是一款客戶端視覺增強模組，能將普通的物品提示轉換為富有表現力且帶有動畫的展示面板。它透過引入流暢的動畫、動態粒子特效以及隨物品稀有度和情境自動適應的裝飾性邊框，為你的背包增添沉浸式的視覺風格。</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BUUrpIP.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">動畫提示</h1>\n        <p>流暢的動畫、發光的邊框與細緻的粒子特效讓每個提示面板栩栩如生。多種樣式支援豐富的視覺裝飾——從動態裝飾到多層疊加效果，讓每件物品都顯得獨特且充滿表現力。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">整合模型</h1>\n        <p>直接在提示面板內以完整整合的 3D 形式查看任何護甲、工具或武器。無需裝備或開啟額外選單即可即時預覽裝備。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nhHUKgM.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/E9yChOe.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">平滑滾動</h1>\n        <p>當提示面板高度超出螢幕範圍時，會自動啟用平滑滾動功能，在保持版面整潔的同時確保文字清晰可讀。讓你自然閱讀長篇說明，無需調整使用者介面大小。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">智慧換行</h1>\n        <p>智慧的換行功能讓寬幅提示面板保持整潔、易讀且格式完美。長名稱、背景故事與數值都會對齊排列，不會溢出版面。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gUXvCIP.jpeg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4yIqabL.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">無可匹敵的自訂功能</h1>\n        <p>《Obscure Tooltips》是最早推出全動畫、視覺豐富提示面板的模組。儘管此後出現了類似的模組，但其模組化、資料驅動的設計仍提供獨特且極具彈性的方式，讓你能夠 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-styles\" rel=\"nofollow\">建立</a>\n  和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523style-merging-fallback\" rel=\"nofollow\">合併樣式</a>， \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523tooltip-filters\" rel=\"nofollow\">設定條件</a>，\n  並 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fobscurialithium.github.io%252fobscure-tooltips%252f%2523core-concept\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂每個元素</a> 以完美契合你的設計構想。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<h2>遊戲內設定</h2>\n<p>在 Minecraft 1.20.1 中，若使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config Screens</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a> 模組，即可啟用遊戲內設定選單。未安裝這些模組時，所有設定仍可透過設定檔進行調整（<em>config/obscuria/obscure_tooltips-client.toml</em>）。自 Minecraft 1.21.1 起，遊戲內設定畫面已原生內建，無需額外依賴模組。</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWVa1rL.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0F3Uyq.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillager-caravans\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lPK6BrB.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elixirum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMZKr3b.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjJSLI0.png\" width=\"45%\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lV9g9R.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Y7y8mO.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>",
